      "timestamp": "2018-03-02T04:10:01Z",
      "user": "Winged Blades of Godric",
      "userid": 19939090,
      "size": 6666,
      "comment": "Declining submission: Firstly, I will like to thank Bkissin who has already made some salient observations.\nNow, slightly broadening:--\n*The sources provided by you fail to establish GNG, which demands significant coverage.Some of the sources mention the subject but ''trivially''.Letters-to-editor are seldom reliable.The HPR report is typical PR stuff.It may be noted that allmost ''all'' running candidates in some significant election manage to secure such trivial amounts of coverage.\n*[[WP:STUB|Length of the article]] is not a reason against acceptance of the draft, provided notability is justified.There are tens of thousands of two-sentence biographies on footballers but all of them pass [[WP:NFOOTY|the subject-specific notability guideline]].\n*AFDs are super-consistent in upholding [[WP:NPOL]] and far better candidates than this with more significant sourcing routinely gets axed.\n*Also see [[WP:BLP1E]] ([[WP:AFCH|AFCH]] 0.9)",
      "minor": false,
      "tags": []
    },
